<title>USA: Idaho Housing $25 mln bond deal restructured. [CORRECTED 21:36 GMT]</title>
<headline>Idaho Housing $25 mln bond deal restructured. [CORRECTED 21:36 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects amounts in table for 2026 and 2028 maturities)</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co. said Wednesday it restructured its Idaho Housing and Finance $25 million bond deal.</p>
<p>The restructure follows:</p>
<p>IDAHO HOUSING AND FINANCE ASSOCIATION</p>
<p>RE: $25,000,000*</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE BONDS, 1997 SERIES E</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD BASED ON THE FOLLOWING RESTRUCTURING AND</p>
<p>REPRICING.</p>
<p>ALL ORDERS ENTERED IN 2016 WILL MOVE TO 2014.  ALL ORDERS</p>
<p>ENTERED IN 2028 WILL</p>
<p>BE MOVED TO 1/1/2026.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE CHANGE IN DELIVERY DATE.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT WILL BE CLOSED.</p>
